The cardinals emphasized the need for dialogue and collaboration in addressing the challenges facing the Church.   枢机主教们强调，需要通过对话与合作来应对教会面临的挑战。
Pope Leo XIII was known for his deep devotion to social justice and his efforts to modernize the Catholic Church's engagement with the world.   教皇利奥十三世以对社会正义的深切关注以及推动天主教会与现代社会接轨的努力而闻名。
The new pope was selected not only for his diplomatic skills but also for his reputation as a reformer who could guide the church into a more inclusive future.   新教皇之所以被选中，不仅因为他的外交才能，还因为他作为改革者的声誉，被认为能够引导教会走向一个更加包容的未来。
The new pope, known for his humble background and deep devotion, has already begun making changes within the Vatican to promote greater transparency and reform.   这位新教皇以谦逊的出身和虔诚的信仰著称，已经开始在梵蒂冈推行促进透明度和改革的举措。
