A separate study conducted by the University of Cambridge found that regular physical activity can significantly improve mental health among young adults.   剑桥大学进行的一项独立研究发现，规律的体育锻炼可以显著改善青年人的心理健康。
The study also examined how regular physical activity and diet influenced participants' mental health and overall well-being.   这项研究还探讨了规律的体育锻炼和饮食如何影响参与者的心理健康和整体幸福感。
Studies also suggest that people who go to bed and wake up later tend to have higher levels of stress and lower overall life satisfaction.   研究表明，那些晚睡晚起的人往往压力水平更高，整体生活满意度更低。
