This study highlights the importance of long-term follow-up research to better understand the potential effects of lifestyle factors on overall health.   这项研究强调了长期随访研究的重要性，以更好地理解生活方式因素对整体健康可能产生的影响。
Increased stress levels and poor sleep quality are also known to interact with each other and contribute to the development of mental health disorders.   增加的压力水平和睡眠质量差也相互关联，并可能促成心理健康问题的发展。
